_:b0_r26b3 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Proof of Movement: Metaconceptual Art";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r26b4 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "work:movement-record";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r26b5 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The Movement Record turns the claim for Metaconceptual Art into a citable textual work and a machine-readable evidence surface. It distinguishes local validity from external canonization while pointing to Linked Art, Wikidata, Getty vocabularies, IIIF, schema.org, and the git-derived Activity Stream.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r26b6 crm:P14_carried_out_by mca:sun-and-rain-works;
    crm:P15_was_influenced_by wd:Q18692990, mca:concept-metaconceptual-art;
    crm:P4_has_time-span _:b0_r26b7;
    a crm:E65_Creation;
    rdfs:label "Writing of the Movement Record".
_:b0_r26b7 crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    a crm:E52_Time-Span;
    rdfs:label "2026".
_:b0_r27b0 crm:P2_has_type <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>;
    crm:P75i_is_possessed_by mca:sun-and-rain-works;
    a crm:E30_Right;
    rdfs:label "CC BY 4.0".
_:b0_r27b1 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Sun & Rain Works' conceptual claim to art at auction (2009)";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r27b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "record:priority-live-auction-2009";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r27b3 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Supporting documentation is described at evidence-live-auction-2009 and includes 2008 Sotheby's correspondence and the public catalogue lot. Recommended framing: the artist's asserted conceptual designation of an auction engagement. Avoided claims: 'first in history', publicly witnessed live creation, or precedence over any later artist or event, absent independent recognition and separately published evidence.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r27b4 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The phrase 'made explicit over time' can now be given its earliest located date. On 2013-09-12 the studio principal set the designation down in writing to a university art museum, naming the Sotheby's lot and calling the consignment a performance act of Metaconceptual Art. That letter is the earliest dated articulation of this claim the studio has produced; it is the artist's own declaration, and it postdates the 2009 engagement by four years.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r27b5 crm:P14_carried_out_by mca:sun-and-rain-works;
    crm:P4_has_time-span _:b0_r27b6;
    a crm:E65_Creation;
    rdfs:label "Writing of the conceptual-claim statement".
_:b0_r27b6 crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    a crm:E52_Time-Span;
    rdfs:label "2026".
_:b0_r28b0 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Sun & Rain Works' auction engagement (Sotheby's Photographs, 2009)";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r28b1 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "activity:production-live-auction-2009";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r28b2 crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin "2009-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end "2009-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    a crm:E52_Time-Span;
    rdfs:label "2009".
_:b0_r28b3 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Sun & Rain Works' engagement with Sotheby's Photographs, 2009 (sale N08533): the consignment of an Ansel Adams photograph, 'San Francisco from Twin Peaks' (lot 16), and the artist's designation of that engagement — together with the associated website www.wtfisart.com — as conceptual works. Sun & Rain Works names two works, www.wtfisart.com and WTF is Ansel Adams. The auction as artwork is the concept both works realise; it is not itself a titled work, and an earlier version of this record, which called it the primary work, was wrong. These designations are assertions by the artist, made explicit over time; they are not publicly witnessed live-creation events, and the Sotheby's catalogue does not name Sun & Rain Works.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r29b0 crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    crm:P82b_end_of_the_end "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>;
    a crm:E52_Time-Span;
    rdfs:label "2026".
_:b0_r29b1 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Public linked-data publication of selected Metaconceptual Art records in 2026. This publication makes the movement and selected works machine-readable on the open web; it is not the creation date of Sun & Rain Works, the movement, or all portfolio works.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r29b2 a la:RightAcquisition;
    rdfs:label "Publication under CC BY 4.0, granting the public reuse rights";
    la:establishes _:b0_r29b3.
_:b0_r29b3 crm:P104i_applies_to mca:art-market-reform, mca:construction-museum, mca:eight-sentences, mca:eightfold-sprocket, mca:movement-graph, mca:site-as-artwork, mca:wtfisart;
    crm:P1_is_identified_by _:b0_r29b4;
    crm:P2_has_type <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>;
    crm:P75i_is_possessed_by mca:sun-and-rain-works;
    a crm:E30_Right;
    rdfs:label "CC BY 4.0".
_:b0_r29b4 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International";
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r2b0 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Art Tax";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r2b1 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "work:art-tax";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r2b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "A work of Metaconceptual Art titled by Sun & Rain Works and named, with Art Market Reform, in the studio's letter of 2013-09-12 to the Jordan Schnitzer Museum of Art: a proposal that art sales be taxed, advanced on the local, state, national and international levels, to press for accountability, transparency and regulation in the art market. The studio states, on 2026-09-22, that the work exists and is held in its own collection. The letter remains the only source for it published here, and no image, text or other material of the work is published with this record.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r2b3 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Why this record exists, and how thin it is. This work was absent from the collection until 2026-09-22, although the studio had named it to an institution in 2013 in the same sentence as Art Market Reform, which has had a record throughout. The omission was this collection's. The record is created so that the work the letter names is addressable, and it is thin because of what this collection holds rather than because of what exists: a title, a one-sentence account of the proposal taken from the letter's own words, and the letter as its only source.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r2b4 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "What the letter says, in its own words. It introduces the pair: 'Two popular examples of Metaconceptual Art, which are ongoing through time and space as well, are titled \"Art Market Reform\" , and \"Art Tax\"'. Under the first of the two it sets out what both are for: 'Promoting Art Tax on the local, state, national, and international levels to encourage and promote accountability, transparency, and regulation in the Art Market and Art World.' It states that the goal is 'to begin, encourage, and promote an open discussion' about them, and that a proposal for both had been submitted to the White House two days earlier. The last of these is the studio's report of its own act; no acknowledgement, reply or filing has been produced, and this collection does not assert that the proposal was received or read.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r2b5 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "What is not held, stated so that nobody infers more than there is. This collection holds no image of the work, no text of the proposal, no correspondence about it other than the 2013 letter, and nothing from any year before 2013 that carries the title. The work's dating is therefore an attestation and not a creation date: the title was in use on 2013-09-12, and the letter's own phrase, that the works are 'ongoing through time and space', describes something continuing rather than finished. No creation event is recorded here for that reason. That question is no longer open in one direction. The studio states, on 2026-09-22, that the work exists and is held in its collection, so the thinness of this record is a fact about what has been published here and not about what exists. The statement is the studio's, about its own holdings, and nobody outside the studio has examined the work; no medium, support, measurement or date of making has been supplied, and none is recorded. When the object's particulars and a photograph of it are to hand, this record should describe the object and be replaced by a fuller one.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r30b0 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The Website Itself";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r30b1 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "work:site-as-artwork";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r30b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The public page treated as the artwork: a surface where language, navigation, metadata, revision, and viewing conditions become material. The website is one of the work's forms, not a container for it.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r30b3 crm:P14_carried_out_by mca:sun-and-rain-works;
    crm:P4_has_time-span _:b0_r30b4;
